This site is built with Jekyll on the "academicpages" theme
(https://github.com/academicpages/academicpages.github.io), itself a
fork of "Minimal Mistakes" (https://github.com/mmistakes/minimal-mistakes)
by Michael Rose. The theme is loaded via Jekyll's remote_theme mechanism
and is not vendored in this repository, aside from one small local
customization in _includes/head/custom.html.

The MIT license below applies only to that theme code.

It does NOT apply to the personal and academic content published on
this site — page text, CV, publication and talk lists, teaching
materials, or any images and PDFs under presentations/, publications/,
and teaching/. That content is Copyright (c) 2026 Ondřej Lengál, all
rights reserved, and is not licensed for reuse.

